{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_physics_update",
  "description": "The physics_update state law of the CAM6 physics (stage 2 of the EqESM project; components/cam/src/physics/cam/physics_types.F90:207-495 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork, SCAM run C_JRA_t62_scam_inst, all 48 steps of the dump window, dt = 1800 s). The law is the single state-update step applied after EVERY parameterization: it applies the ptend (already pre-scaled by 1/3 inside the CLUBB/MG2 macro-micro loop) to the state \u2014 u/u, the constituents with the qneg3 qmin floor or the number-concentration min/max clamp (F90:313-334), T via ptend_s*dt/cpairv (F90:415-421, cpairv = cpair because dry_air_species = ''), the CLDLIQ/CLDICE state_cnst_min_nz zeroing at the convect_deep/zm_conv_tend sites (F90:353-375), and the hydrostatic geopotential recompute with the virtual-temperature chain of geopotential_temp.F90:133-216 (non-lagrangian branch: hkl = pdel/pmid; the lagrangian piln branch and the WACCM-X H/H2 caps and cam_thermo_dry_air_update are not exercised by this run and are not transcribed) \u2014 and it accumulates the tendencies into tend%dudt/dvdt/dtdt (F90:287-301, 417-419). tend%flx_net is NOT touched by physics_update (it is accumulated in physpkg.F90:1527/3048 outside the law). The model's lev axis is SURFACE-FIRST (index 1 = the surface layer = dump lev 32, the orientation of the EarthSciDiscretizations column_nonuniform_1d grid whose cumulative-integral rules lower the hydrostatic sums), so every [lev] test array is the dump's lev-1..32 column reversed. The geopotential integrals are written as `integral` and lowered by the imported integral_lev_cumulative_from_bottom / integral_lev_nodes_cumulative_from_bottom rules with the dz = pdel/pmid measure and z_sfc = 0. All 48-step chaining (state_before(k+1) == state_after(k) for every adjacent call-site pair, every level, every constituent, including the geopotential zm/s) is verified at 1e-16 relative against the stage-1 dump; the tests pin steps 1/2/24/48 at the convect_deep, clubb#1, microp#1, aero_calcsize, radiation and vdiff call sites and the tend accumulation against cam_tend_total.csv. Gaps documented in README-cam-physics-update.md: the ac-phase dtdt carries the SE dycore scaling cpairv/cp_or_cv_dycore (physpkg.F90:2026-2030) outside this law, the sslt_rebin_adv sea-salt mutation between convect_shallow and ssatcontrail, the dump's 3-digit-exponent 'E'-dropping quirk, and the qmin provenance (chemistry.F90)."
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "lev": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "NLEV"
  },
  "lev_nodes": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     "NLEV",
     1
    ]
   }
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "NLEV": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 32,
   "description": "Number of CAM vertical levels (pver = 32 in this run)."
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "PhysicsUpdate": {
   "expression_templates": {},
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/integral_lev_cumulative_from_bottom.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NLEV": "NLEV"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/integral_lev_nodes_cumulative_from_bottom.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NLEV": "NLEV"
     }
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "rair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 287.0423113650487,
     "description": "dry-air gas constant rair = SHR_CONST_RDAIR = AVOGAD*BOLTZ/MWDAIR (physconst.F90:102, shr_const_mod.F90:46-48), [J/(kg K)]; the gas constant of the hydrostatic rog = rairv/gravit."
    },
    "gravit": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "default": 9.80616,
     "description": "gravitational acceleration gravit = SHR_CONST_G (physconst.F90:89, shr_const_mod.F90:24-27), [m/s^2]."
    },
    "cpair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 1004.64,
     "description": "specific heat of dry air cpair = SHR_CONST_CPDAIR (physconst.F90:92, shr_const_mod.F90:52-54), [J/(kg K)]; cpairv = cpair because dry_air_species = '' (air_composition.F90:354), so the temperature update divides by cpair."
    },
    "rh2o": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 461.5046398201599,
     "description": "gas constant of water vapor rh2o = SHR_CONST_RWV (physconst.F90:101, shr_const_mod.F90:46-48), [J/(kg K)]; enters zvir = rh2o/rair - 1."
    },
    "z_sfc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "surface coordinate of the geopotential integral bounds (geopotential_temp.F90:128: the surface height is zero by definition; zi(interface_surf) = 0); bound to the z_sfc free name of the imported column_nonuniform_1d integral rules."
    },
    "zvir": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "zvir = rh2o/rair - 1 = SHR_CONST_ZVIR (physconst.F90:102, shr_const_mod.F90:48-49), the water-vapor correction of the virtual temperature; physics_update uses zvirv = zvir in the non-WACCM branch (physics_types.F90:405-409)."
    },
    "rairv": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "local dry-air gas constant rairv_loc of physics_update (physics_types.F90:396-403); with dry_air_species = '' the air_composition rairv = rair (air_composition.F90:354), and the run has no subcolumns, so rairv = rair."
    },
    "cpairv": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "local specific heat cpairv_loc of physics_update (physics_types.F90:388-395): with dry_air_species = '' the air_composition cpairv = cpair (air_composition.F90:354), and the run has no subcolumns, so cpairv = cpair; the temperature update divides by it (physics_types.F90:417-419)."
    },
    "rog": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/K",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "the hydrostatic rog = rair/gravit factor of geopotential_temp.F90:113 (rairv_loc/gravit), the [m/K] integrand factor of the geopotential integral."
    },
    "dz": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "default": [
      0.0,
      0.0,
      0.0,
